  <jpcrp030000-asr_E35238-000:NotesRegardingAccountsReceivableAndAccountsPayableToAffiliatedCompaniesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※２  &lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;関係会社に対する金銭債権及び金銭債務&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
